{"id":"c871e3c00e89d8af","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-bisimulation-back.md","title":"Bisimulation Back Property","display":"lem-bisimulation-back — Bisimulation Back Property","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-bisimulation-back","aliases":["89-lem-bisimulation-back"],"display":"lem-bisimulation-back — Bisimulation Back Property","depends_on":["[[89-df-bisimulation]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-bisimulation-back"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-bisimulation-back</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-bisimulation-back — Bisimulation Back Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&#39;=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\">\\(M&#39;=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\\)</span> are Kripke models.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\">\\(Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;M,M&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;M,M&#39;)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}back}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;M,M&#39;)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall v&#39;\\in W&#39;\\,\n\\bigl(\nw&#39;R&#39;v&#39;\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land(v,v&#39;)\\in Z)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}back}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;M,M&#39;)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall v&#39;\\in W&#39;\\,\n\\bigl(\nw&#39;R&#39;v&#39;\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land(v,v&#39;)\\in Z)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Back性质是双模拟的核心条件之一</li>\n<li>保证后退方向的可达性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"M'=(W',R',V')","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\subseteq W\\times W'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;M,M')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}back}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;M,M')\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall(w,w')\\in Z\\;\\forall v'\\in W'\\,\n\\bigl(\nw'R'v'\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land(v,v')\\in Z)\n\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":794,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f233d5485efaad7c","ab746eb779e20ce0"]}